#
# Module
#
ModuleCloudBackupName = CloudBackup
Module95040Name = CloudBackup
Module95040Desc = Scheduled backup and restore of the database and the documents, to S3, FTP, SFTP or a directory, as an encrypted restic repository or as plain archives
CloudBackupDescription = Scheduled backup and restore of the database and the documents, to S3, FTP, SFTP or a directory, as an encrypted restic repository or as plain archives
CloudBackupDescriptionLong = Backs up the database (with the PHP dump of the backup tool of Dolibarr) and the documents directory, on a schedule or on demand, and restores them from Dolibarr itself. Works on shared hosting: no shell, no system package, only PHP extensions. The restic format is encrypted and deduplicated, and can be read with the restic command line tool.
CloudBackupMenu = Cloud backup
CloudBackupJob = CloudBackup: back up the database and the documents
CloudBackupRightRead = See the backups and their history
CloudBackupRightRun = Run a backup
CloudBackupRightRestore = Restore a backup (replaces the database and the documents)
CloudBackupRightSetup = Configure the backups (storage, password, retention, check)

