# Setup
#
CloudBackupSetup = CloudBackup setup
CloudBackupSetupPage = Where and how the database and the documents are backed up. The scheduled job is in Home > Setup > Scheduled jobs; it runs on shared hosting through the cron task of the hosting panel or through an external URL call.
