CloudBackupWhere = Destination
CloudBackupFormat = Format
CloudBackupFormatHelp = restic: encrypted, deduplicated (only what changed is sent), readable with the restic tool. Archives: a zip of the documents and a gzipped SQL dump per backup, readable without any tool, not encrypted.
CloudBackupFormatRestic = restic repository (encrypted, incremental)
CloudBackupFormatArchive = Plain archives (zip + sql.gz)
