CloudBackupKeptFiles = Kept by the last restore
CloudBackupOrphanFilesHelp = Documents stored in the directory of an invoice, order, proposal, contract, third party or social contribution that no longer exists in the database. Same rule as the repair tool of Dolibarr.
CloudBackupOrphanIndexLinesHelp = Lines of the file index of Dolibarr (ecm_files) whose file is not on the disk any more. Deleting a line only removes it from the index.
CloudBackupKeptFilesHelp = Documents the last restore found on the disk but not in the backup, and kept. The restored database may not know them any more.
